# Cline — Lens Design System

## Canonical Rules
All rules, prohibitions, and governance live in:
→ CLAUDE.md (read this first, always)

## Lens Knowledge Base
→ .lens-knowledge-base/_ROUTER.md (find any file)

## Cline-Specific Notes

### Before any UI task
1. Read CLAUDE.md
2. Read .lens-knowledge-base/guides/LENS_THINKING.md
3. Route via .lens-knowledge-base/_ROUTER.md

### Quick API differences from common libraries
| Need          | Wrong                | Correct Lens             |
|---------------|----------------------|--------------------------|
| Box/Container | div, Box             | Container                |
| Flex layout   | Flex, flex div       | Split                    |
| Grid layout   | Grid, grid div       | Arrange                  |
| Heading       | h1, Heading          | Text size="heading-lg"   |
| Disabled      | disabled             | isDisabled               |
| Loading       | loading              | hasLoader                |
| Element type  | as="a"               | htmlTag="a"              |
| Button icons  | leftIcon             | iconBefore               |
| Ref           | ref={ref}            | refHandler={(r)=>...}    |
| Icon          | raw SVG              | Icon icon={SvgName /}    |

### Decision Flow
1. UI need identified
2. COMPONENT-INDEX.md — does Lens have it?
3. YES → components/[Name].md for API
4. NO → compose from primitives + Lens tokens
5. Pattern repeats → // TODO: [LENS-GAP]